// Magenta KEY (255,0,255) is "transparent": Clear(KEY) and fills/strokes with KEY clear to alpha 0.
// SmoothingMode default (None) → antialiasing OFF for fills/strokes (pixel-crisp like GDI+); text is always antialiased.
